[WORK]
UID: WORK-SCRIBE-DRY-RUN-ARGPARSE-API
TITLE: Replace private argparse traversal in the dry-run flag injector
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The dry-run flag injector walks argparse's private \_SubParsersAction and
\_actions attributes because argparse exposes no public subparser traversal API.
Replace that private-API dependency with a parser registry or another public
construction seam before a Python upgrade can silently break write-leaf
coverage.
<<<
